# Run control and run artefacts, never source.
.diggle-stop
spike-run.md
# The timestamped archive of each run's report and raw console. Kept on disk so a run cannot erase
# the evidence of the one before it, and out of git because they are observations, not source — the
# ones worth keeping get quoted into `handoff/` with the reasoning attached.
spike-run-*.md
spike-run-*.log
